#: of pwnlib.elf:1
msgid ""
"Most exploitable CTF challenges are provided in the Executable and "
"Linkable Format (``ELF``).  Generally, it is very useful to be able to "
"interact with these files to extract data such as function addresses, ROP"
" gadgets, and writable page addresses."
